{
  "id": "V03",
  "title": "Gravity statics D / L / Lr",
  "intent": "One wall under a full-line uniform (D / L / Lr), a partial uniform that runs past the wall end, and an off-centre point load. Proves the statics end reactions per load case, the resisting moment about each corner, that load over no wall is not carried (audit note, excluded — the checks still pass), and the governing ASD combinations with live and roof live load.",
  "covers": [
    "Gravity statics R_R = Σ P·x / L",
    "C3 M_R about each corner",
    "ASCE 7-22 §2.4.1 (2), (4), §2.4.5 (5), (6), (8)",
    "gravity_unsupported audit note",
    "G4 / G8 excluded loads"
  ],
  "handCalc": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "text": "SW-1 runs x = 4–14 ft on a 20 ft line, h = 10 ft. x below is measured from the wall left end."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "text": "Load pieces on the wall: full line 100 / 50 / 40 plf over 4–14 ft → P = D 1.000 / L 0.500 / Lr 0.400 k at x = 5.00 ft; partial 200 / 100 plf over 6–14 ft (of 6–18) → P = D 1.600 / L 0.800 / Lr 0.000 k at x = 6.00 ft; point 3 / 2 / 1 k at line x = 7 ft → P = D 3.000 / L 2.000 / Lr 1.000 k at x = 3.00 ft; self-weight 10 psf × 10 × 10 → P = D 1.000 / L 0.000 / Lr 0.000 k at x = 5.00 ft."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "text": "Not carried (over no wall): full line 0–4 and 14–20 ft (D 1.00 / L 0.50 / Lr 0.40 k) and partial 14–18 ft (D 0.80 / L 0.40 k) → audit notes, excluded in the gravity checks."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "text": "Totals ΣP: D 6.600 / L 3.300 / Lr 1.400 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "text": "M_R about the right corner (→) = Σ P·(L − x): D 37.400 / L 19.700 / Lr 9.000 k·ft; about the left corner (←) = Σ P·x: D 28.600 / L 13.300 / Lr 5.000 k·ft."
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "text": "Reactions: R_R = Σ P·x / L = D 2.860 / L 1.330 / Lr 0.500 k; R_L = ΣP − R_R = D 3.740 / L 1.970 / Lr 0.900 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "text": "Lateral: V = 4 k, v = 0.7 × 4000 / 10 = 280.00 plf → 6\" o.c.; N_E = 4 × 10 / 10 = ±4.00 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "text": "Left-end compression by combination: D = 3.7400; D + L = 5.7100; D + Lr = 4.6400; D + 0.75L + 0.75Lr = 5.8925; (1.0+0.14S_DS)D + 0.7E ← = 1.14 × 3.7400 + 0.7 × 4.00 = 7.0636; (1.0+0.105S_DS)D + 0.525E + 0.75L ← = 1.105 × 3.7400 + 0.525 × 4.00 + 0.75 × 1.9700 = 7.7102 → governs C_L = 7.7102 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 9,
      "text": "Right-end compression: combo (6) → = 1.105 × 2.8600 + 0.525 × 4.00 + 0.75 × 1.3300 = 6.2578; combo (5) → = 6.0604 → C_R = 6.2578 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 10,
      "text": "Uplift (0.6 − 0.14S_DS)D + 0.7E: left (→) 0.7 × 4.00 − 0.46 × 3.7400 = 1.0796 k; right (←) 0.7 × 4.00 − 0.46 × 2.8600 = 1.4844 k → HDUE3 at the right."
    },
    {
      "step": 11,
      "text": "Left end post (HDUE3 minimum post (2)2x4, sizes tried in catalog order at 10 ft): (2)2x4 5.00 k, (3)2x4 7.50 k, 4x4 5.83 k, 6x4 9.14 k, 8x4 12.47 k → first with cap ≥ C_L = 7.710 k is 6x4."
    },
    {
      "step": 12,
      "text": "SW-1 (Eq. 4.3-1, → governs): v = 1000 × 4.000 / 10 = 400.00 plf, A = 15.75 in², G_a = 16 k/in → 8vh³/(EAb) = 0.0120; vh/(1000G_a) = 0.2500; Δ_HD = 0.127 × 4000.00 / 3790 (ASD cap) = 0.1340 (HDUE3, T = 4000.00 lb); r = 4000.00 / (15.75 × 625) = 0.4063 → Δ_c = 0.0111; h·Δa/b = 10 × (0.1340 + 0.0111) / 10 = 0.1452 → δ = 0.4071 in."
    },
    {
      "step": 13,
      "text": "Story drift Level 1: δxe = the largest wall δ = SW-1 0.4071 in → δx = Cd·δxe/Ie = 4 × 0.4071 / 1.0 = 1.628 in vs Δa = 0.020 × 10 × 12 = 2.400 in → OK."
    }
  ],
